  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "On the ninety-ninth night, Noah finally saw the exit.",
      "tag": "[mysterious]",
      "pause": 0.3,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_00.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "A glowing gate appeared between the trees.",
      "tag": "[in awe]",
      "pause": 0.3,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_01.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "He had survived the forest.",
      "tag": "[conversational]",
      "pause": 0.2,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_02.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "The creatures.",
      "tag": "[ominous]",
      "pause": 0.12,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_03.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "The freezing nights.",
      "tag": "[ominous]",
      "pause": 0.12,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_04.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "And the endless darkness.",
      "tag": "[ominous]",
      "pause": 0.65,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_05.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "But when Noah approached the gate, a message appeared.",
      "tag": "[mysterious]",
      "pause": 0.55,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_06.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"ONE PLAYER STILL MISSING.\"",
      "tag": "[slowly]",
      "pause": 0.4,
      "speak": "One player still missing.",
      "voice": "system",
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_07.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Noah checked his team list.",
      "tag": "[conversational]",
      "pause": 0.15,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_08.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Everyone was accounted for.",
      "tag": "[mysterious]",
      "pause": 0.6,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_09.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then he noticed something strange.",
      "tag": "[mysterious]",
      "pause": 0.15,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_10.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "The campfire was still burning.",
      "tag": "[mysterious]",
      "pause": 0.25,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_11.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "And beside it sat a tiny figure.",
      "tag": "[softly]",
      "pause": 0.15,
      "speak": "And beside it, sat a tiny figure.",
      "local": {
        "src": "en_us_007"
      },
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_12.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "A child wearing an old red jacket.",
      "tag": "[softly]",
      "pause": 0.6,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_13.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Noah had never seen him before.",
      "tag": "[mysterious]",
      "pause": 0.55,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_14.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "The child looked up.",
      "tag": "[softly]",
      "pause": 0.15,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_15.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Are we going home now?\"",
      "tag": "[softly]",
      "pause": 0.4,
      "speak": "Are we going home now?",
      "voice": "boy",
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_16.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Noah hesitated.",
      "tag": "[tense]",
      "pause": 0.45,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_17.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "The gate was beginning to close.",
      "tag": "[tense]",
      "pause": 0.15,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_18.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "He could leave.",
      "tag": "[tense]",
      "pause": 0.4,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_19.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Or go back.",
      "tag": "[tense]",
      "pause": 0.3,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_20.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Noah ran toward the campfire.",
      "tag": "[urgent]",
      "pause": 0.1,
      "speak": "Noah. Ran toward the campfire.",
      "local": {
        "src": "en_us_009",
        "rate": 0.95
      },
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_21.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "He grabbed the child's hand.",
      "tag": "[urgent]",
      "pause": 0.1,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_22.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "And sprinted toward the gate.",
      "tag": "[urgent]",
      "pause": 0.1,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_23.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "They jumped through just as it vanished.",
      "tag": "[urgent]",
      "pause": 0.75,
      "local": {
        "src": "en_us_009",
        "rate": 1.0
      },
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_24.wav",
      "speak": "They jumped through, just as it vanished."
    },
    {
      "text": "Suddenly, Noah was standing in a bright Roblox town.",
      "tag": "[warm]",
      "pause": 0.25,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_25.wav",
      "speak": "Suddenly, Noah was, standing in a bright Roblox town.",
      "local": {
        "src": "en_us_007",
        "rate": 0.95
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The child smiled.",
      "tag": "[warm]",
      "pause": 0.45,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_26.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Thank you.\"",
      "tag": "[softly]",
      "pause": 0.35,
      "speak": "Thank you.",
      "voice": "boy",
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_27.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then a notification appeared.",
      "tag": "[mysterious]",
      "pause": 0.2,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_28.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"THE FIRST PLAYER HAS FINALLY ESCAPED.\"",
      "tag": "[slowly]",
      "pause": 0.75,
      "speak": "The first player has finally escaped.",
      "voice": "system",
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_29.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "And the forest disappeared from the map.",
      "tag": "[warm]",
      "pause": 0.3,
      "audio": "build/ep25/local_lines/line_30.wav"
    }
  ],
